=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Weapons<br/>Distance Weapons<br/>Throwing Weapons</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3.60 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10 - 40 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6.0<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">November 3, 2000<br/>Version 6.0 Beta</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20071212173559&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Small_Stone_095661.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a small stone <span class=\"p-attributes\">(Atk:5, Def:0)</span>.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 3.60 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>The weak attack rating makes them useless as a primary weapon, however, this same characteristic makes them ideal to train with, and these are frequently used by paladins to train their distance skill.<br/>\nExperiments show that, on average, 3 out of a 100 small stones will break when used. These have the identical range of <a href=\"#/wiki/Throwing%20Star\">throwing stars</a>.\nThe easiest way of getting small stones is by hunting <a href=\"#/wiki/Apes\">apes</a>. <a href=\"#/wiki/Sibang\">Sibangs</a> drop them quite frequently. <a href=\"#/wiki/Earth%20Elemental\">Earth Elemental</a> also drop nice amounts, but are considerably stronger to defeat. Note that if small stones are cheaper than 36 gp/piece it might not be worth looting them if you are low on cap.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-object-proficiency\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Weapon_Proficiency\">Weapon Proficiency</span></h3>\n<div class=\"weapon_proficiency weapon_proficiency_border\">\n<table class=\"weapon_proficiency_number_table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>5\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table class=\"weapon_proficiency_table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_block weapon_proficiency_border\"><div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_icon\" title=\"Attack Damage\">\n<div></div>\n<div><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250625211543&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Border_Active_417a88.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"img32\"><img alt=\"32?cb=20251104183605&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_General_ed04f0.png\"/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">+1 attack</div></div></div>\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_block weapon_proficiency_border\"><div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_icon\" title=\"Attack Damage\">\n<div></div>\n<div><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250625211543&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Border_Active_417a88.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"img32\"><img alt=\"32?cb=20251104183605&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_General_ed04f0.png\"/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">+1 attack</div></div></div>\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_block weapon_proficiency_border\"><div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_icon\" title=\"Attack Range\">\n<div></div>\n<div><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250625211543&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Border_Active_417a88.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"img32\"><img alt=\"32?cb=20251104183605&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_General_ed04f0.png\"/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">+1 range</div></div></div>\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_block weapon_proficiency_border\"><div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_icon\" title=\"Attack Damage\">\n<div></div>\n<div><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250625211543&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Border_Active_417a88.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"img32\"><img alt=\"32?cb=20251104183605&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_General_ed04f0.png\"/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">+3 attack</div></div></div>\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_block weapon_proficiency_border\"><div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_icon\" title=\"Auto-Attack Critical Extra Damage\">\n<div></div>\n<div><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250625211543&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Border_Active_417a88.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"img32\"><img alt=\"32?cb=20251104183605&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_General_ed04f0.png\"/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">+200% critical extra damage for auto-attacks</div></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>Before the Winter Update 2007, Small Stones looked like this: <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Small Stone (Old)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Small_Stone_Old_35c25a.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span><br/>\nThey were once a common drop of <a href=\"#/wiki/Goblin\">Goblins</a> (Even 3 pieces per kill). The price has increased dramatically since they are dropped less commonly. After Summer Update 2009, the drop rate of small stones by goblins was lowered and prices became higher.<br/>\nAfter the Summer Update 2012, their price dropped significantly due to the implementation of <a href=\"#/wiki/Training%20School\">offline training</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Animated%20Ogre%20Brute\">Animated Ogre Brute</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Arctic%20Faun\">Arctic Faun</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Clay%20Guardian\">Clay Guardian</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cursed%20Book\">Cursed Book</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Faun\">Dark Faun</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20%28Goblin%29\">Demon (Goblin)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Earth%20Elemental\">Earth Elemental</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Eternal%20Guardian\">Eternal Guardian</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Faun\">Faun</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Frost%20Giante